                                                "sense_id": "7fbe3b87-5420-3a8a-b2a8-ab258e5b961b",
                                                "text": "Angry city councillors lashed out against both Broadway and Ottawa on Wednesday, claiming the Doer government and the Harper Conservatives are spending millions on infrastructure projects Winnipeg doesn't want and not enough on road repairs the city needs."
